<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Ɓi Efes</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɓi Efes</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi Efes</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi Efes</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ɓaahee ŋ Israayel ci, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ɓi Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> A nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tum ci 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> Ŋ finho <char style="w">Paantakot</char>, wi Janguuni camb ɓaatuk, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi tolfiɗee kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58-8:3">Tum ci 7:58–8:3</ref></char></note> Waaye wa raakka mbeh, a cohha na Yeesu, a kossa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-30">Tum ci 9:1-30</ref></char></note> po a nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> sah. Teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" teeɓohiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe wi a nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wa Pool koc kaɗ Efes wa nikee ŋ reehɗohaaniŋ ɓaaɓiŋ ɗe yakki kanakɗoh,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:40-18:22">Tum ci 15:40–18:22</ref></char></note> wa nikee kaɗ rohƴiɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Tum ci 18:19-21</ref></char></note> Dokkissaŋ ɗe nga, wa nikee ŋ ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe yakka kaahayɗoh, a tumeen nga ini uup kiis kanak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:1-20:1">Tum ci 19:1–20:1</ref></char></note> Wa a wiirkee ŋ ɓaaɓeem, a lahha ŋ sero Efes, a raakee coh na yakak caŋ Janguucaŋ Efes.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:17-38">Tum ci 20:17-38</ref></char></note> Wa degga ɓi kiis, a kaɗta <char style="w">Rom</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27-28">Tum ci 27–28</ref></char></note> findi ambuuɗi joy atte'u. Wa miniɗ nik ne ŋ jamanoonaam weɗ a fiisoh kaɓɗohii wuu kosiɗ ciŋ Efes, wa a naandsuku in neɓiɗ kerah ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Janguucaŋ kur kaŋ ɓa. Wa namiɗ min nik ne kaɓɗohi a fiis ɓi Kolos na Filemoon, a woosoh ca ŋ jamanooneem.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:21">Ɓi Efes 6:21</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7-9">Ɓi Kolos 4:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:10">Filemoon 1:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Pool fiis kaɓɗohi ne a ñaah ɓi Efes, a jangiɗ ɓa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kosi ɓa kos.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi Efes kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool kañɗiɗ ɓi Efes <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool corkiɗiɗ Kooh ŋ muci a tufkiɗ bala Adina fersan <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-14">1:3-14</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool kiimɗiɗ ɓi Efes Kooh <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:15-19">1:15-19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Yaki <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> yak <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:20-23">1:20-23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Baahohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-10">2:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nik yino <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 2:11-22">2:11-22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pangkiŋ Pool : Teeɓoh ini Kooh ɗasɗe, te wi hotuk kotii <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 3:1-13">3:1-13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kiim Kooh ne ɓi Efes inah baahiɗ waaɗohi nik ŋ Kiristaani <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 3:14-21">3:14-21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kosiɗ ci mand na cir ciŋ faani te Kiristaani a yi hafi <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 4:1-16">4:1-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Jangɗoh wuu kipes ki asi <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 4:17-5:20">4:17–5:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Jangɗoh wuu kipes kiŋ kahan <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 5:21-6:9">5:21–6:9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ganaay ci Kooh eɗ kosiɗ ci <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 6:10-20">6:10-20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Askohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Mi yii kañiɗ ɗu, ɗu ɓi <char style="w">ɓo'-Kooh ci</char> nik [ŋ Efes]. Mi yi Pool, <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="apootar">Apootariŋ</char></char> <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu ŋ ini Kooh waaɗ, mi yii fiis ɗu, ɗu ɓi hool wuu Kooh te ɗu carra oolku ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Kooh Baabiŋ ɓoo baahohaat ɗu, a on ɗu jam ; Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗi baahohaat ɗu, a on ɗu jam !<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Barke mitiɗ ŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Eey Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:3">yi nik Koohiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:3">a nammba nik Baabiŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:3">a yakɗaah ;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 1:3" />
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:3">ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ Kiristaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:3">a barke'ɗiɗ ɓoo ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:3">barke nu nik ŋ ɗafki.<verse eid="EPH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Ŋ Kiristaani, Kooh taniɗ ɓoo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:4">bala Adina camban,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:4">ne ɓoo hool wuu ce</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:4">te ɓoo raakuu sikka ŋ fikiice.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 1:4" />
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:4">Ŋ waaɗohiŋ ɗe,<verse eid="EPH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />a ambeen ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:5">a hey ɓoo tume kuɓuuciŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:5">taamboh ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 1:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:5">Ineem weɗ a waaɗ ŋ baah kiŋ ɗe,<verse eid="EPH 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />ne ɓoo ƴeek</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:6">yaki baahohi a baahoh ɓoo yak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:6">wi a on ɓoo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:6">ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ Kiristaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:6">yi a waaɗ.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Ŋ aami a aam ñif miŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:7">a pulɗohiɗ ɓoo ŋ baahaaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:7">ɓoo ɗaasuuɗ bakaaɗ ci.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:7">Weɗ yakkiŋ baahohiŋ Kooh,<verse eid="EPH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />a eɗta ɓoo nga laayiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:8">wa hunnda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:8">na liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ nu nik</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:8">na kiñaañ nu nik.<verse eid="EPH 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />A inhiɗiɗ ɓoo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:9">ini ɗasɗukiɗiŋ ini a waaɗee tum.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:9">A tufkiɗeen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:9">ŋ baah kiŋ ɗe ne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:9">a heya tume taamboh ŋ Kiristaani.<verse eid="EPH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Ineem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:10">a hey wa tume ŋ jamanoonaŋ wa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:10">weɗ ne a ambsoh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:10">in ci nik ŋ Eel ci na kehƴi jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:10">a deg Kiristaani ŋ hafiŋ ca.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ɓaatta nga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:11">ŋ niki ɓoo nik nga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:11">ɓoo rahsiɗ ɓakiŋ ɓoo ŋ gapohi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:11">laam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:11">Kooh taniɗ ɓoo maañ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:11">wa nikee ini a tufkiɗee tum</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:11">sagu ne a waaɗee wa waaɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:11">Te in nu Kooh tufuk tum ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:11">a tuma findi a waaɗoha.<verse eid="EPH 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Ɓoo ƴeekaat yaki a yak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:12">ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:12">ɓi koc ooluk Kiristaani.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:13">wa ɗu kerah woo kiŋ keeh ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:13">
    <char style="w" lemma="Yegɗohiŋ Muci">Yegɗohiŋ Muciŋ</char> ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:13">ɗu nameen ɗe kos,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:13">te ŋ niki ɗu nik nga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:13">Kooh eɗiɗ ɗu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:13">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani gapohse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:13">ne a nik ñaasi teeɓoh ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:13">ɗu wuu ce.<verse eid="EPH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:14">a yi firnde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:14">ne in ci Kooh gap cuuɓiŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:14">ɓoo hey ca rahse.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:14">Ɓoo hey ca rahse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:14">mbeha ɓoo pulɗassan ŋ miskiɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 1:14">Kon, ɓoo ƴeekaat yaki a yak.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool kiimɗiɗ ɓi Efes Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Ineem weɗ tah po, wa ŋ kerah poyi kosi ɗu kos Yeesu Heɗi na waaɗi ɗu waaɗ ɓo'-Kooh ci jen, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />ŋ gen corkiɗ Kooh ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗu. Ŋ ɓaahndohee ɗu ŋ kiim ci mi na kiimee ɗe. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Ini mi na kiimɗee ɗu, weɗ ne Koohiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa, Baabi raak kiyak ki, on ɗu Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani yi onan ɗu liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ te a teeɓ ɗu ya ɓa Kooh po ɗu inah ɗe keeh-keeh.<verse eid="EPH 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />A ñiinɗaat has ciŋ ɗu na keeñ ciŋ ɗu, ne ɗu inah yaakaari a on ɗu wa a ɓeeɗuk ɗu, ɗu nam inah findi gapohiŋ ɗe yakoh ŋ ɓo'-Kooh ci <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />na findi hatiliŋ ɗe yakoh ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa, maanaam ŋ ɗooƴ ɓoo ɓi kos. Weɗ hatili yakohngaani <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />Kooh hultiɗoh Kiristaani, weɗ hatili a nam ɗe ɓoofɗoh ŋ yaah ñaahmiŋ ɗe, ŋ ɗafka.<verse eid="EPH 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Kiristaani ɓoofɗuuɗ ŋ ɗafuk ki'adug nu nik, ŋ ɗafuk kikilifa nu nik, ŋ min-min nu nik, ŋ hatil nu nik na in nu raak tiik ɗah, ngaŋ adinaanii dong haa, waaye na adinaani na haye. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Kooh on Kiristaani ne a adgoh in ci jen, a degga ɗe ŋ ɗafuk in ci jen, a onnda Janguuni ɗe, ne a nik hafiŋ Janguuni. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Janguuni weɗ faaniŋ Kiristaani ; ŋ ɗooƴ Janguuni, a yii nga keeh-keeh, te a yi mitiɗ in ci jen.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">E baahoh na tahe ɓo' mucɗu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Ini kaɗ nga ɗu, ɗu nikee kaaniɗ sagu ɗal ciŋ ɗu na bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Ɗu taambɗee pesohaaɗiŋ adinaanii, ɗu taambɗee Seytaani yi adgoh feruuɗ ci baahaaɗiici raak hatil ŋ harmban kehƴi na Eel ci, a yi na tumɗukohe ɓi sang Kooh. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Ɓoo jen, ɓoo ɓaahee ŋ ɓi sang Kooh, ɓoo pesohee taambiɗ kiñin ciŋ ɓoo ɗeɓgaan, ɓoo meeɗ tum ini faan ciŋ ɓoo na liiɓ ciŋ ɓoo waaɗ, te findi ɓoo nikohee, ɓoo sekɗohsee ayrukiŋ Kooh findi ɓinooɓi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Waaye Kooh laayiɗ yirmoh, te waaɗi keeh-keehi a waaɗ ɓoo, tahiɗ po, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />ali ɓoo nikee kaaniɗ sagu ɗal ci sah, a ambsohiɗ ɓoo na <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>, a onnda ɓoo kipes ; inhaat ne a baahoh tah ɗu mucɗu. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, a hultiɗiɗ ɓoo na Kiristaani, a ɓoofiɗta ɓoo na ɗe ŋ Eel ci. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Ineem na teeɓohe baahohiŋ ɗe laayohngaani ŋ jamanooci na haye, taamboh ŋ baahi a baah nga ɓoo ŋ ini Kiristaani Yeesu tum.<verse eid="EPH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />A baahoh tah ɗu mucɗu, taamboh ŋ kos. Ineem pulohɗi nga ɗu, wa onohiŋ Kooh ; <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />tumohaaɗ ci tahɗi, ne ali ɓo' yaksiɗkuu nga. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Laam ɓoo haɓɗuuɗ ciŋ Kooh, a feris ɓoo ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, ne ɓoo tum in ci baahiɗ ci a kooɗkiɗ ɓoo po ƴutta, ne ɓoo pesoh ca.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nik yino ngaŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Ɗu nikeeɗi Yawuut ngaŋ ñif. Ɓi na woye haf ɓa <char style="w" lemma="nguɗuk">nguɗkiɗ</char> ci te ɓa nguɗuk ŋ faan - e yaah ɓo' nguɗ ɓa - ɓa woyeeɗa ɗu nguɗkaaɗiici. Ŋ ineem, naandsukaat inii : <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Ɗu raakeeɗi Kiristaani ŋ jamanoonaam, ɗu ɓaaheeɗi ŋ cuuɓiŋ Israayel na ambtiɗoh ciŋ Kooh na ɓa, na gapohi ca puloh. Ɗu nikee ŋ Adina, ɗu raakeeɗi yaakaar, ɗu raakeeɗi Kooh. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Waaye kotii, ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, ɗu ɓi use, ɗu reɓiɗ, taamboh ŋ ñif miŋ ɗe.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Laam a Kiristaani ŋ haf ce jamiŋ ɓoo, a yi ambsoh Yawuut na nikaaɗi Yawuut, a tummba ɓa yino ; wa a eɗoh faaniŋ ɗe, a sannja ɗingi saɓsohee ɓa, maanaam sangtiɗoh. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />A ɓarngiɗta nakoh ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na tumaah ciŋ wa, ne a tum Yawuut na nikaaɗi Yawuut yino, a feris ɓa ɓo' as ŋ niki ɓa nik nga ɗe ; a tufkiɗoh jam ɗaa. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Ini a waaɗee tum, weɗ ne kanak ci nik yino, a tummba po ɓa kerhiɗohha na Kooh, te taamboh ŋ kurwaani, a appa sangtiɗohi nikee ŋ harmban ɓa. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />A hayya woye yegɗoh baahiɗ, jam wuu ɗu, ɗu ɓi use, na jam wuu ɓi reɓe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Marka teerndiŋ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Esayi 57:19</ref></char>.</note>. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Taamboh nga ɗe, ɓoo miniɗ reɓ Baabi, ɓii na ɓum ngaŋ Fuuɗis yino, <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Ŋ ineem, ɗu nikisɗi hanhe wala ɓooɓi genohaah ; waaye ɗu gentoh ciŋ <char style="w">ɓo'-Kooh ci</char>, ɗu ɓaah ŋ ɓi gen na Kooh kotii. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Ɗu taɓahu ŋ <char style="tl">fondamaani</char>, maanaam <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci na woosuuɗ ci, te Kiristaani Yeesu ŋ haf ce nikka atoh fi amb taɓahi. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />A yi amb taɓahi jen, po ɓak ci jen taɓahsee moɗoɗ, wa ɓaatee yak po wa nik kahan Kooh, hoolɗuuɗ taamboh ŋ Heɗi. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Ŋ niki ɗu nik nga ɗe, ɗu na name taɓahu ne ɗu hun na kosiɗ ci jen, ɗu nik genoha, wi Kooh genohan taamboh ŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Pangki Pool naku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ineem weɗ tah, mi Pool, mi yi ambu ŋ kaso sagu pangki ŋ pangkiɗ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu wuu ɗu ɓi nikɗi Yawuut...<verse eid="EPH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />A', ɗu kerhiɗ pangki Kooh deg go de' ! Pangki a deg go wuu ɗu, ŋ baahohiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Kooh ŋ haf ce, a inhiɗiɗ to ini ɗasɗukiɗi a tufuk tum maañiɗ, te ŋ fiissa ɗu wa ŋ rohƴiɗ. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Ɗu janga ɗah, ɗu hey hote inhi ŋ inah ini ɗasɗukiɗeem, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kiristaani. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Kooh teeɓɗi ɓooɓi ɗeɓgaan wa findi a teeɓoha woti-woti <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci na woosuuɗ ci a hooliɗ wuu ce, taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>.<verse eid="EPH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Ini ɗasɗukiɗeem weɗ ne, ŋ niki ɓa nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, taamboh ŋ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, ɓi nikɗi Yawuut ɓaah lamaahi na Yawuut ci, ɓa ɓaah ŋ faaniŋ Kiristaani, maanaam Janguuni te ɓa namiɗ raak ɓak ŋ gapohi.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Yegɗoheem weɗ mi na pangkiɗe kotii ; weɗ ini Kooh baahoh ho, a tummbaa na hatiliŋ ɗe. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />A ñam uup ƴissuut ŋ <char style="w">ɓo'-Kooh ci</char> jen, moona Kooh baahohiɗ to ne ŋ yegiɗ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut in ci baahiɗ ciŋ Kiristaani ɓo' minɗi kind. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Kooh namiɗ to baahoh ne ŋ ñiiniɗ wuu ɓooɓi [jen], findi a na tiindɗohe ini a tufuk tum. Kooh yi fer in ci jen, a yi ɗasɗee ineem ŋ ɗooƴ ce ŋ jamanooci coot jen.<verse eid="EPH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />In ceem ñiinɗuuɗ kotii ne, heɗ hatil ci nik ŋ ɗafki, ci raak kikilifa na min-min, inah findi liiɓohaaɗiŋ Kooh moɗoh ŋ ɓak ciŋ wa jen taamboh ŋ Janguuni.<verse eid="EPH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Ineem jen hun na ini Kooh tufkiɗee bala jamanooci coot jen. A tufkeen ne a heya tume, te a tumiɗa kotii, taamboh ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, Heɗ ɓoo. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Ŋ niki ɓoo nik nga ɗe, ɓoo oolkiɗ Kooh po ɓoo miniɗ ɗe reɓ supkaaɗi, taamboh ŋ kosi ɓoo kos Kiristaani. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Kon, kinaat faɗsuk, ali nik ne ŋ raakiɗ miskiɗ ŋ pangkiŋ ngo wuu ɗu sah, ambaat ne wa wuu yakɗiŋ ɗu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inah waaɗohiŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ineem weɗ tah, mi yii ƴekiɗ Baabi, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />yi cuuɓ ciŋ Eel ci na kehƴi jen kooɗoh tiik ciŋ ca. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Mi yii kiim ɗe ne a on ɗu ŋ findi yakkiŋ ɗe hend, ɗu ndeng na hatil ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu, taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ ɗe</char>. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />Mi yii kiim ne Kiristaani gen ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɗu taamboh ŋ kos. Ɗu deƴuk te ɗu ndeng ŋ waaɗoh, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />po ɗu ambsukoh na ɓo'-Kooh ci jen, ɗu min inah findi waaɗohiŋ Kiristaani angoh, wa hutta, wa ɗafukka te wa nooɗta. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Ee, ɗu min inah waaɗi a waaɗ ɓoo, ineem weɗ uup ki'inah nu nik, te ɗu hey riife jameet na Kooh haf ce.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Kooh, ŋ hatiliŋ ɗe, na pangke ŋ ɗooƴ ɓoo, te a miniɗ tum ini uup fuuf ini ɓoo na kiime wala liiɓe. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />A yakɗaah ŋ Janguuni, a nam yakɗaah ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu ŋ gomal nu gomal, wa gen po faw ! Amiin !<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kosiɗ ci, ɓeɗ faaniŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Kon ineem weɗ tah, mi yi taƴu ŋ kaso sagu Heɗi, mi yii ñaah ɗu keeh-keeh, ne ɗu pes pes huniɗ na ɓeeɗki ɗu ɓeeɗku, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />ɗu gen eɗfiɗ, ɗu nik ɓo' soosiɗ, ɗu min muñ ɗu seke, yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah teyɗukaat morom ce ŋ waaɗoh. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Te ɗu ndengɗuk ɗu amb baahiɗ niki ɗu nik yino, wi <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> eɗ ɗu, taamboh ŋ jami ambsoh ɗu.<verse eid="EPH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />A faan yino dong raak, wa nikka kosiɗ ci, a Fuuɗis yino dong raak ; wa yaakaar yino dong nam raak, te yaakaareem, Kooh ɓeeɗuk ɗu ne ɗu rahasa. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />A Heɗ yino dong raak na kos yino na ɓoktuk yino. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />A Kooh yino dong nam raak, Baabiŋ ɓooɓi jen, yi na nguurke ŋ ɓooɓi jen, a yi na pangke taamboh ŋ ɓooɓi jen te a yi nik ŋ ɓooɓi jen.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Waaye yaa nu nga ɓoo ɗah, na onohi Kooh baahoh ɗe findi <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> ɓeesɗoh ɗe wa. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ineem weɗ Fiis ci woo an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">« A rapiɗ ŋ ɗafka ɗafka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">a ɓayndohha feruuɗ ci a deg yaah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">te raakka in ci a on ɓo' ci. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Sabuur 68:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />"A rapiɗ" wa tokis ye ? Wa joy tokis ne a ruhseen po ŋ kehƴi haa e ? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Yi ruhus, a yi nam rap ŋ ɗafuk Eel ci jen, ne a riif adinaani jen.<verse eid="EPH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Ŋ ineem, a onnda ɓum, ɓa nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char>, ɓum, a onnda ɓa ne Kooh woyee taamboh nga ɓa, ɓum, a onnda ɓa ne ɓa yegɗohee <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, ɓum, a onnda ɓa ne ɓa niiɗee ɓooɓiŋ Janguuni, ɓum, a onnda ɓa ne ɓa min jangɗoh. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />A oniɗ ɓooɓeem ne ɓa ɓaatɗoh ɓooɓiŋ Kooh po ɓeem min pangkiɗ Kooh baahiɗ, ne faaniŋ Kiristaani min kaɗ fiki.<verse eid="EPH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Ŋ ineem, ɓoo jen ɓoo hey kaɗe po ɓoo nik yino, ɓoo ɓaah kos te ɓoo ɓaah inah <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>, ɓoo hey kaɗe po ɓoo nik yakak jameet, ɓoo hend na Kiristaani ŋ miti a mit. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Ɓoo nikissanɗi komaaki, ɓoo ñaañohsee na jangɗoh nu nik findi gaali ginaah ci na puuɗsi na giyaange ; ɓoo faɗanɗi ɓooɓi ɓa taambohee ŋ herñiŋ ɓa, ɓa nookee ɓoo ŋ ini nikɗi keeh.<verse eid="EPH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Ɓoo pesohee keeh te wa hun na waaɗoh ɗah, ɓoo hey hooɗe ŋ in ci jen, kaɗee ŋ Kiristaani, yi hafi. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Te wa taamboh nga ɗe, faani jen findi wa hend, hunnda ambsukohha. Pok ciŋ wa jen ceɗ ɓekɗukoh, tummbaa faan yino, te cir nu nik na tume pangkiŋ wa, faani hooɗe, kaɗee fiki taamboh ŋ waaɗoh.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kipes as ŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Inii weɗ mi na woyee ɗu, mi yii deng ɗu wa ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi, weɗ ne : Ɗu joyisɗi pes findi kosaaɗiici, ɓa na ñaakɗe liiɓ ci raakɗi haf, raakɗi kose. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Ɓa ñaañ ñaañ ñuusiɗ te ɓa raakɗi ali ɓak ŋ kipes ki Kooh na onohe, sagu inhaaɗiiki nik nga ɓa te wa puloh ŋ ndengi keeñ ciŋ ɓa ndeng. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Ɓa waaskiɗ kaci, ɓa ɓekiɗ haf ɓa ŋ cakaay ne ɓa tumee in hoolaaɗi nu nik po ɓa uupiɗ nga.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Waaye ɗu, ineem weɗ ɗu jang ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kiristaani haa ! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Ŋ inhiɗ ne ɗu kerhiɗ tiikiŋ ɗe, te ɗu jangɗuuɗ keeh ki nik nga ɗe. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Mbaa, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ mandohaaɗiŋ ɗu ɗeɓgaan, saɓsukohaat na kiɓo' kiŋ ɗu maañiɗa, wa na taambɗe kiñin kiŋ wa, wa ñaañohee ɗa po wa ɓek ɗa ŋ sooƴ. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Faɗaat Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani a tum ɗu ɓo' as ŋ liiɓohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Te ɗu ɓekuk kiɓo' as, wi feru ŋ findi Kooh waaɗoh taamboh ŋ hool wuu Kooh na yurah, ci puloh ŋ keeh.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Saɓsukohaat na lee, te yaa nu nga ɗah woyee morom ce keeh ; laam, ɓoo jen ɓoo cir, te ɓoo nikka faan yino.<verse eid="EPH 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Ɗu ayruk ɗah, kinaat bakaaɗ ; nohi kinaat muyoh ayrukiŋ ɗu ; <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />kinaat on Seytaani waas.<verse eid="EPH 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Yi nikee rokoh, kinaat rokis ; a ɗaɓañɗukaat ŋ panguk panguk yurhiɗ na yaah ciŋ ɗe, ne a min raak ini a onan yi raakɗi.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Ali woo moɗaaɗi kinaat puloh ŋ nguɓ ciŋ ɗu, waaye ɓo' raak woyaah moɗiɗ ɗah, a woyaat woo ki ɓaatɗohan ɓooɓi ne ɓa kaɗ fiki ŋ in ci ɓa etoh, ne wa baahoh ɓi na sikɗukee ɗe.<verse eid="EPH 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Kinaat ɓek Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaaniŋ Kooh tiis, Fuuɗsi fu inah ne a yi Kooh eɗ ɗu ne a nik ñaasi teeɓoh ne ɗu wuu ce. Ñaaseem weɗ na name teeɓoh ne mbehi Kooh saɓsohan ɗu jameet na baahaaɗi, wa hey haye.<verse eid="EPH 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Kinaat ɗaak aay-keeñ, kinaat nik ɓo' neɓaaɗi'iɗ, usaat ayruk na ɗuuɗ na ɓasoh, na añaand nu nik.<verse eid="EPH 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Baahaat ŋ harmban ɗu, ɗu keeñtiɗkohe ; ɗaastiɗohaat findi Kooh ɗaasoh ɗu ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Kiristaani.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Kon nikaat ɓooɓi na altiɗkohe Kooh, findi kuɓuuciŋ ɗe a keeñkoh, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />te pesaat ŋ waaɗoh, findi <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> waaɗoh ɓoo, po a eɗohha haf ce wuu ɓoo, wa nikka findi seeƴuk eeñiɗ ngaŋ Kooh.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Faankoh sangohuuɗ na hoolaaɗi nu wa min nik ɗah wala waaɗ kopor, ca kinaat sah kerhu nga ɗu, findi wa joy nikoh ŋ <char style="w">ɓo'-Kooh ci</char>. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Woo moɗaaɗi kinaat kerhu nga ɗu wala woo naandoha, wala woo añndoh baahaaɗi, in ceem moɗɗi ; waaye woo ciŋ ɗu nikaat corkiɗoha Kooh. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Inhaat baahiɗ ne, ali ɓo' ŋ ɓi na faankohe faankoh sangohuuɗ wala hoolaaɗiici wala waaɗiɗ kopor ci - maanaam ñaamkoh kooh nikaaɗi - ali ɓo' nga ɓa heyɗi ɓaahe ŋ Nguuriŋ Kiristaani na Kooh.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nikaat ŋ siñaari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Ali ɓo' kinaat ɗu ñaañoh na woo raakaaɗi ; laam ineem weɗ na tahe po ayrukiŋ Kooh keenee ŋ sangiɗ ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Kon kinaat ɓaah ŋ in ci ɓa na haɓɗe. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Ɗeɓgaan ɗu nikee kuɓu ñuus, waaye kotii, ɗu siñaar ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Heɗi. Kon pesaat findi kuɓu siñaar. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Siñaari na rime nga ɗu in baahiɗ nu nik na yurhiɗ na keeh. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Jeemaat inhisoh ini neɓ Heɗi ; <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />kinaat ɓaah ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ñuusi, ca onɗi ɓo' ali in, ɗu kay, teeɓohaat ca teeɓoh. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />In ci ɓa na tume ŋ ɗasɗuk, wa kaci ne ca woysee sah. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Waaye in nu teeɓohu ɗah, wa hotuk baahiɗ ŋ siñaar, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />laam e siñaari na teeɓohe in ci jen. Weɗ tah wa fiisuuɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">« Yunka, fu yi na neehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">hulta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Kiristaani hey ɗa siñaarɗe. »<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Kon markaat baahiɗ ŋ findi ɗu na pesohe ; kinaat nik ɓo' naandiɗ, nikaat ɓo' raakiɗ liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Tondkaat ŋ jamanooni Kooh on ɗu ne ɗu haɓiɗ in ci ɗu min, laam jamanooni woti baahɗi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Kinaat nik ɓo' naandiɗ, jeemaat inhisoh ini Heɗi waaɗ. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Kinaat laar ŋ sangara, wa na ɓekohe ŋ mbalay, ɗu kay, riifaat na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />ɗu woyee ŋ harmban ɗu na ƴeek ciŋ <char style="tl">Sabuur</char> na ƴeek corkiɗoha Kooh, na ƴeek ci puloh ŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani jen ; ƴeekaat ɗu yakɗee Heɗi na keeñ ciŋ ɗu jen. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Genaat corkiɗ Kooh Baabi ŋ in nu nik, taamboh ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ƴaar na ɓitiice</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah teyɗukɗaat morom ce sagu nupi ɗu nup Kiristaani. <verse eid="EPH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Ɓitiɓ ci, teyɗukɗaat ƴaar ciŋ ɗu, findi ɗu teyɗukɗoh Heɗi. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Laam ƴaar a yi yilif ɓitiice, findi Kiristaani yilfoh ɓi Janguuni, ɓeɗ ɓi faaniŋ ɗe te a nikka Mucɗohiŋ ɓa. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Kon, findi Janguuni teyɗukɗoh Kiristaani, ɓitiɓ ci joy teyɗukɗoh ƴaar ciŋ ɓa ɗaa, ŋ in nu nik.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Ƴaar ci, waaɗaat ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɗu, findi Kiristaani waaɗoh Janguuni na findi a eɗoh haf ce wuu Janguuni, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />ne a tuma wuu Kooh taamboh ŋ hoolɗi a hooliɗa ŋ ɓooki a ɓooka na masuɓ na Woo ki. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Weɗ a tum ne a ɓay Janguuni ŋ fikiice findi ɓitiice, a hota, na moɗkiŋ wa, raakaaɗi didim, wa ñugurɗukohuu, wa raakuu ali in mand ɗaa, wa hool fec, te wa raakuu ali sikka. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Ƴaar ci joy waaɗoh ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɓa ɗaa, findi ɓa waaɗoh faan ciŋ ɓa haf ɓa. Yaa nu waaɗ ɓitiice ɗah, a waaɗ haf ce.<verse eid="EPH 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Laam ali ɓo' moosɗi sangoh faaniŋ ɗe haf ce ; a na pesɗee wa pesiɗ, a taambkohee wa, findi Kiristaani na tume na Janguuni, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />weɗ faaniŋ ɗe, te ɓoo jen cir nga.<verse eid="EPH 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Fiis ci woo ne : « Weɗ tah ƴaar hey saɓsukohe na paamu, na ndaamu, a ŋoɗ ŋ ɓitiice, jaar ɓa kanak ɓa nik faan yino. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Camba 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Woo keem, wa in nooɗiɗ nik nga ; ñam woo ne ineem na woye ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kiristaani na Janguuni. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Ini wir te wa woorra, weɗ ne yaa nu nga ɗu waaɗaat ɓitiice findi a waaɗoh haf ce, te ɓitiɓ eɗ ƴaar ce cir.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Harmban kuɓu na ɓi rim ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Ɗu ɓi komaakci, kerhiɗaat yaay ciŋ ɗu na baab ciŋ ɗu findi Heɗi waaɗoha, ineem weɗ waas. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Fiis ci woo ne : « Eɗa yaay ɗu na baab ɗu cir. » - weɗ nakohi koc wi hun na gapoh - <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />an : « Wa hey baahe nga ɗa te fu raak kipes hutiɗ ŋ kehƴi. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Pula 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Rohƴiɗi 5:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Ɗu ɓi baab ci, kinaat ayrukiɗ kuɓuuciŋ ɗu, koɗaat ɓa, ɗu deg ɓa ŋ waas te ɗu deng ɓa findi Heɗi waaɗoha.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Harmban ñaam na heɗ ce</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Ɗu ɓi <char style="w">ñaam</char> ci, kerhiɗaat heɗ ciŋ ɗu ŋ adinaanii, wa hun na neƴƴoh na eɗ cir, tumaata na keeñ hooliɗ po haa ɗu na pangkiɗe <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> ; <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />wa kinaat nik ŋ has ciŋ ɓa dong, po haa ɗu na waake ini neɓ ɓa, te ɓa ɓo' dong, waaye wa nikaat findi ñaam ciŋ Kiristaani, ɓi na tume ini Kooh waaɗ na keeñ ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Pangkiɗaat ɓa na keeñ soosiɗ, findi ɓoyi na pangkiɗe Heɗi waaye findi ɓoyi na pangkiɗe ɓo' haa. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Inhaat ne yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah, a nik ñaam wala a nikɗi ñaam, in baahiɗ nu a tum ɗah, Heɗi hey ɗe wa dokne.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Ɗu ɓi heɗ ñaam ci, tumohaat ɗaa na ñaam ciŋ ɗu ; faɗaat ɓa gapuk tum miskiɗ, te ɗu inah ne e ɗu ɓaah Heɗ yino, a yi ŋ Eel ci te a na talsoheeɗi ɓo'.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ganaay ci Kooh eɗoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Ini tas weɗ ne, raakaat hatil ŋ Heɗi, ŋ hatiliŋ ɗe laayohngaani. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Ɓayaat ganaay ci Kooh eɗoh jen, ne ɗu min yurhiɗkoh tumohaaɗ ciŋ Seytaani. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Laam ɓoo hiñohɗi na heɗ faan na ñif, waaye ɓoo na hiñohe na heɗ hatil ci nik ŋ ɗafki, ci raak kikilifa na min-min na doole ŋ adinaani ñuusiɗii, ɓoo na hiñohe na feruuɗ ci baahaaɗiici minɗi hotu jen. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ineem weɗ tah, ɓayaat ganaay ci Kooh eɗoh jen ; ŋ ineem, mbeh baahaaɗi hay ɗah, ɗu min hiñoh baahaaɗiineem te ɗu tum ini ɗu joy tum jen po ƴut ɗah, ɗu ris tufkiɗ jing.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Kon, tufkaat jing ; tokohaat kinoh ciŋ ɗu keeh ki, kiyurah nik kulɓa niiɗoha fisaaciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Ñafaɗ ciŋ ɗu nikaat sawar kaɗ yegɗoha <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> na onohe jam. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Ŋ in ceem jen, ɓaataat kos nga, wa nik ɗipkoha ɓis, ne ɗu min ƴim ɓis ci kaɓɗuuɗ ci Seytaani na weesee ɗu jen. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Teyaat kongi, weɗ muci, ɗu nam ɓay ndangiŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, wi nik woo kiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Ŋ in ceem jen, genaat kiim Kooh, kiimaat ɗe ne a ɓaatɗoh ɗu. Ŋ in nu wa min nik ɗah, kiimaat Kooh, taamboh ŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani te ɗu neehuu ; ŋoɗaat nga, ɗu kiimɗee <char style="w">ɓo'-Kooh ci</char> jen. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Namaat to kiimiɗ Kooh, ne ŋ rangis nguɓ, ŋ woyee na ɓooɓi ɗah, ŋ rahas woo ci ŋ etoh inhiɗohaa ɓa Yegɗohiŋ Muci, wi nik kumpa nga ɓa, te ŋ neƴƴohuu nga. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Yegɗohiŋ Muci weem, weɗ tah ho nikiɗ Heɗi ndii ŋ kasooni. Kiimɗaat to Kooh ne ŋ woo na ooluk findi ŋ joy woyoh.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tisikos, ɓaah ɓoo yi ŋ keeñkoh, a cariɗ oolku ŋ pangkiŋ Heɗi, a hey ɗu woye jen ne ɗu nam inah ini ŋ nikoh. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ŋ woosiɗ ɗe nga ɗu ne a woo ɗu ini ɓoo nikoh te a soosiɗ keeñ ciŋ ɗu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Kooh Baabi na Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗi onaat ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci jam na waaɗoh na kos ! <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Ɓi waaɗ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa waaɗi na reeheeɗi, ɓa baahohsaat jen !<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>